Maintainer: Pierre Kisters <pierrekisters@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: pve-cloudinit-extras
Architecture: all
Depends: pve-manager (>= 9.2), pve-manager (<< 10), qemu-server, libpve-storage-perl,
 libjson-perl, libtemplate-perl, ${misc:Depends}
Description: custom files, commands and include for the Proxmox VE Cloud-Init tab
 Adds "Custom files" (cicustom), "Commands" (runcmd) and "Include" (snippet or
 URL) rows to the VM Cloud-Init panel. Commands and Include are written into a
 per-VM multipart vendor-data snippet by a small API endpoint. GUI and API hooks
 are marker lines in pve-manager files, re-applied by dpkg triggers after
 upgrades, gated by version and removed exactly on uninstall.
